{title: 310 - I Would Draw Nearer to Jesus}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #310 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 310}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]I would draw [F7]nearer to [Bb]Je[Bbdim6]sus,   [F7]In His sweet presence a[Bb]bide,
[D7]Constantly trying to [Gm]serve Him, [C]Safe and se[C7]cure at His [F]si[F7]de.
[Bb]I would draw [D]nearer to Je[Eb]sus, [C7]I would draw nearer to [F7]Him;
[Bb]Fully sur[Eb]rendered each [Bb]moment, [F]I would draw [F7]nearer to [Bb]Him.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]I [F7]would draw [Bb]nearer to [Bbdim6]Jesus, [F7]Nothing withholding [Bb]from Him,
[D7]Knowing He [Gm]loves to [C]be gracious, [C7]I would [F]draw nearer [F7]to Him.
[Bb]I would [D]draw nearer [Eb]to Jesus, I [C7]would draw [F7]nearer to Him;
[Bb]Fully [Eb]surrendered each [Bb]moment, I [F]would [F7]draw nearer [Bb]to Him.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]I would [F7]draw nearer [Bb]to Jesus, [Bbdim6]Seeking Hi [F7]strength to [Bb]be true,
[D7]Willing to [Gm]tell of [C]His goodness, [C7]Gladly His [F]blest will [F7]to do.
[Bb]I would [D]draw nearer [Eb]to Jesus, I [C7]would draw [F7]nearer to Him;
[Bb]Fully [Eb]surrendered each [Bb]moment, I [F]would [F7]draw nearer [Bb]to Him.
{end_of_verse}
